# Core design only; source identities and proof receipts remain in Org.
title: WEAVER / ENROLLMENT CREDENTIAL / SUBJECT AUTHORITY {
  class: title
  near: top-center
}
protocols: GO / CLOUD NATIVE IDENTITY {
  top: 0
  left: 0
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f7faf9"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  mcp: Shared workload is eligibility only\nExisting independent subject identity\nProducer binds the canonical launch {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  a2a: Subject and enrollment possession\nOne complete issuance transcript\nAuthentic channel / audience / purpose {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  acp: Recover the original credential\nCurrent subject / read authorization\nNo rebind or freshness from a reply {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  goBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/go.svg
    top: 247
    left: 24
    width: 42
    height: 22
  }
  kubernetesBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/kubernetes.svg
    top: 247
    left: 82
    width: 28
    height: 28
  }
}
registry: SCHEME / ORIGINAL CONTRACT {
  top: 0
  left: 440
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f8fafb"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  origin: Original semantic commitment\nCanonical claim / profile / history\nReservation and retained tail {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  alias: Cedar Code as Policy\nAuthenticate facts before evaluation\nCurrent approval at the final owner CAS {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
  query: Enrollment never authorizes LLM sends\nOriginal unknown reservation stays held\nRevocation crosses downstream fences {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
}
recovery: RUST / CREDENTIAL AUTHORITY {
  top: 0
  left: 880
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f7faf9"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  projection: Commit exact subject / enrollment key\nUnique launch and credential identity\nPersist before requesting a signature {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  join: Request and release the exact body\nRetry the same credential after lost replies\nA signature alone is no authority {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
  fence: Restore the accepted outer commit prefix\nJoin credential / release / root outcome\nQuarantine incomplete recovery images {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
}
broker: RUST / ONLINE ROOT ACTIVATION {
  top: 0
  left: 1320
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f8fafb"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  cas: Fresh holder proof / bootstrap channel\nCAS current policy / source / epoch\nRoot and activation outcome together {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
  alias: Keep the first beneficiary key\nRoot activation creates no execution grant\nFinal sends retain independent gates {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
  hold: Late signature cannot bypass a new epoch\nRetain original subject / key / outcomes\nUnknown use keeps the budget hold {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  rustBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/rust.svg
    top: 40
    left: 156
    width: 34
    height: 34
  }
}
quint: QUINT\nForwarded credentials / identity races / split recovery\nLost signing replies / stale callbacks / old workers {
  top: 810
  left: 220
  width: 610
  height: 100
  class: policy
}
lean: LEAN\nIndependent subject provenance / immutable credential / joined roots\nActual first-key and original budget composition {
  top: 810
  left: 960
  width: 610
  height: 100
  class: semantic
}
protocols.mcp -> registry.origin
protocols.a2a -> registry.alias
protocols.acp -> registry.query
registry.origin -> recovery.projection
registry.alias -> recovery.join
registry.query -> recovery.fence { style.stroke-dash: 4 }
recovery.projection -> recovery.join
recovery.join -> recovery.fence
recovery.fence -> broker.cas
broker.cas -> broker.alias
broker.alias -> broker.hold
broker.hold -> broker.cas: Read current prefix { style.stroke-dash: 4 }

